        "agent": "product-strategist",
        "profiles": {
          "lean": "skip",
          "standard": "optional",
          "enterprise": "required"
        },
        "note": "The price book under the GTM's pricing decision: tier matrix with fences, list prices, bottom-up business case, discount give-get policy (Ramanujam and Tacke). standard: write it when the GTM has two or more tiers aimed at different segments, when anyone besides the product owner can discount, or when the user asks; otherwise the GTM's pricing section is enough."
