          "enterprise": "required"
        },
        "note": "Written after the opportunity solution tree and before the functional requirements; its goal is the tree's product outcome, in fields. lean: no map, epics trace to the Key Result. standard (when produced): one map for the outcome the first release serves. enterprise: one map per product outcome in scope under impact-maps/, with shared actor names. Ends in a selected path with typed assumptions, signals and a re-plan trigger, never a MoSCoW column (impact-mapping)."
      },
